  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:12.420" end="00:15.470" ttm:agent="v1">Hundred dollar bills are not enough to stop a heartbreak</p>
      <p begin="00:15.470" end="00:18.710" ttm:agent="v1">But twenty dollar bills is all I got inside my pocket</p>
      <p begin="00:18.710" end="00:21.200" ttm:agent="v1">I'm flat broke but you don't care</p>
      <p begin="00:21.200" end="00:24.060" ttm:agent="v1">You spent all my cash on your make-up and hair</p>
      <p begin="00:24.060" end="00:25.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You said)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.080" end="00:27.900" ttm:agent="v1">Hundred dollar bills are not enough to stop a heartbreak</p>
      <p begin="00:27.900" end="00:31.050" ttm:agent="v1">But twenty dollar bills is all I got inside my pocket</p>
      <p begin="00:31.050" end="00:33.540" ttm:agent="v1">I'm flat broke but you don't care</p>
      <p begin="00:33.540" end="00:36.650" ttm:agent="v1">You spent all my cash on your make-up and hair</p>
      <p begin="00:36.650" end="00:39.850" ttm:agent="v1">We went from left to right but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="00:39.850" end="00:42.840" ttm:agent="v1">Then we went up and down, but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="00:42.840" end="00:46.180" ttm:agent="v1">Now was it you or was it me, cause you got all of the money</p>
      <p begin="00:46.180" end="00:49.950" ttm:agent="v1">It was you it wasn't me, cause you got all of the money yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:49.950" end="00:53.620" ttm:agent="v1">You don't understand how much it hurts</p>
      <p begin="00:53.620" end="00:56.670" ttm:agent="v1">Standing outside on the curb</p>
      <p begin="00:56.670" end="00:58.330" ttm:agent="v1">While it's raining</p>
      <p begin="00:58.330" end="01:02.530" ttm:agent="v1">Man it's pouring out it hurts oh</p>
      <p begin="01:02.530" end="01:04.840" ttm:agent="v1">All the pain that I be getting everyday</p>
      <p begin="01:04.840" end="01:08.160" ttm:agent="v1">You can hit me anywhere but baby I'm still getting paid</p>
      <p begin="01:08.160" end="01:11.080" ttm:agent="v1">When they tell me that I'm balling man I don't know what to say</p>
      <p begin="01:11.080" end="01:14.700" ttm:agent="v1">Cause I'm hiding all the scars with the money that I made but</p>
      <p begin="01:14.700" end="01:17.680" ttm:agent="v1">Hundred dollar bills are not enough to stop a heartbreak</p>
      <p begin="01:17.680" end="01:20.830" ttm:agent="v1">But twenty dollar bills is all I got inside my pocket</p>
      <p begin="01:20.830" end="01:23.330" ttm:agent="v1">I'm flat broke but you don't care</p>
      <p begin="01:23.330" end="01:26.490" ttm:agent="v1">You spent all my cash on your make-up and hair</p>
      <p begin="01:26.490" end="01:29.680" ttm:agent="v1">We went from left to right but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="01:29.680" end="01:32.710" ttm:agent="v1">Then we went up and down, but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="01:32.710" end="01:36.000" ttm:agent="v1">Now was it you or was it me, cause you got all of the money</p>
      <p begin="01:36.000" end="01:39.860" ttm:agent="v1">It was you it wasn't me, cause you got all of the money yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:39.860" end="01:42.130" ttm:agent="v1">You got the money and the diamonds in the bag</p>
      <p begin="01:42.130" end="01:46.270" ttm:agent="v1">But I get nothing more than heartaches inside of my fucking head, why</p>
      <p begin="01:46.270" end="01:49.420" ttm:agent="v1">What have I done to deserve the pain?</p>
      <p begin="01:49.420" end="01:52.350" ttm:agent="v1">What have I done to deserve the hate?</p>
      <p begin="01:52.350" end="01:54.960" ttm:agent="v1">Don't understand baby is this not enough?</p>
      <p begin="01:54.960" end="01:58.590" ttm:agent="v1">I gave you all my time trade it in for all your love oh</p>
      <p begin="01:58.590" end="02:01.070" ttm:agent="v1">Don't understand baby is this not enough?</p>
      <p begin="02:01.070" end="02:04.660" ttm:agent="v1">I gave you all my money trade it in for all your love but</p>
      <p begin="02:04.660" end="02:07.470" ttm:agent="v1">Hundred dollar bills are not enough to stop a heartbreak</p>
      <p begin="02:07.470" end="02:10.660" ttm:agent="v1">But twenty dollar bills is all I got inside my pocket</p>
      <p begin="02:10.660" end="02:13.320" ttm:agent="v1">I'm flat broke but you don't care</p>
      <p begin="02:13.320" end="02:16.510" ttm:agent="v1">You spent all my cash on your make-up and hair</p>
      <p begin="02:16.510" end="02:19.460" ttm:agent="v1">We went from left to right but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="02:19.460" end="02:22.440" ttm:agent="v1">Then we went up and down, but we're still stuck in here</p>
      <p begin="02:22.440" end="02:25.980" ttm:agent="v1">Now was it you or was it me, cause you got all of the money</p>
      <p begin="02:25.980" end="02:30.750" ttm:agent="v1">It was you it wasn't me, cause you got all of the money yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:30.750" end="02:33.900" ttm:agent="v1">You got all of the money yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:33.900" end="02:36.320" ttm:agent="v1">You got all of the money yeah</p>
